{"code":2000,"codename":"Koyuki","data":{"id":216,"skin":"","skin_jp":"","skin_cn":"","skin_zh_tw":"","skin_list":[{"id":216,"avatar":"//static.kivo.wiki/images/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/Student_Portrait_CH0080_Collection.png","skin":"","skin_cn":""}],"family_name":"京极","given_name":"皋月","family_name_jp":"京極","given_name_jp":"サツキ","family_name_kr":"쿄고쿠","given_name_kr":"사츠키","family_name_en":"Kyougoku","given_name_en":"Satsuki","family_name_zh_tw":"京極","given_name_zh_tw":"皐月","family_name_cn":"京极","given_name_cn":"皋月","nick_name":"","momo_talk_signature":"长期征集受试者 / 详情请咨询万魔殿","main_relation":24,"relation":[25],"age":17,"grade":"三年生","height":172,"birthday":"04-10","hobby":"研究精神控制、购物","designer":"本田ロアロ","illustrator":"Mx2J","character_voice":"樱井浩美","character_voice_cn":"","release_date":"2024-11-20","release_date_cn":null,"release_date_global":"2025-05-13","school":3,"weapon_type":"HG","is_install":true,"is_install_cn":false,"is_install_global":true,"is_npc":false,"show_list":true,"body_shape":"Large","special_appearance":true,"spine":[101,606,868],"model":[178,231],"voice":[{"description":"CH0080_Cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"来收集下夏莱的情报吧。","text_original":"シャーレの情報収集といきましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"哼~？感觉不错呢。","text_original":"ふ～ん？いい感じじゃない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"让那些孩子们潜入这里……","text_original":"ここにあの子たちを潜入させて……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"其他组织的审问技术，有点在意呢……","text_original":"うち以外の尋問技術、気になるわね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"有没有人愿意……当我的催眠术练习对象呢？","text_original":"催眠術の練習台……誰かなってくれないかしら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"弱点在……这里吧。","text_original":"弱点は……ここね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_CommonSkill.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_1","category":"event","text":"哼~，这么缠着我……想让我做什么呢？","text_original":"ふ～ん、そんなにちょっかいを出して…何をされたいの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_2","category":"event","text":"老师是，想要些什么呢？","text_original":"先生は、なにをご所望かしら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"呵呵，老师……试试催眠我吧。","text_original":"ふふっ、先生…私に催眠をかけてみなさい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"对我当然是没用……嗯？不试了吗？","text_original":"もちろん私には効かな…うん？遠慮しておく？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_3_3","category":"event","text":"呵呵，别那么说嘛……来，试试看。","text_original":"ふふっ、そんなこと言わずに…ほらほら。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"像这样发呆的话，会被真琴缠上的哦？","text_original":"そんな風にぼんやりしていたら、マコトちゃんに絡まれてしまうわよ？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"来，过来这边。","text_original":"ほら、こっちに来なさい。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_1","category":"event","text":"欢迎光临，老师。随意看看吧。","text_original":"いらっしゃい、先生。好きなだけ見ていって頂戴。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_2","category":"event","text":"这可是我们万魔殿主办的派对。老师一定会喜欢的对吧。","text_original":"私たち万魔殿が手掛けたパーティーだもの。先生も気に入るに決まってるわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_Season_1_1","category":"event","text":"哎呀，进展似乎不太顺利呢。","text_original":"あら、進捗が芳しくないようね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_Season_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_Season_1_2","category":"event","text":"不过嘛，真琴会想办法解决的吧？","text_original":"まあ、マコトちゃんがなんとかするんじゃない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_Season_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_Season_2","category":"event","text":"没想到在这里还需要老师的帮助呢。呵呵，拜托您了哦，老师？","text_original":"ここで先生の手を借りることになるなんてね。ふふっ、頼んだわよ、先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_Season_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_Season_End_1","category":"event","text":"派对到此结束了。","text_original":"パーティーはこれで終わり。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_Season_End_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_EventLogin_Season_End_2","category":"event","text":"怎么样？我说过，一定会顺利解决的吧？","text_original":"ね？私の言ったとおり、なんとかなったでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_EventLogin_Season_End_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"你变得越来越~强、越来越~强……","text_original":"あなたは段々つよくなぁ～る、つよくなぁ～る……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"来吧，为我而努力吧。","text_original":"さあ、私のために頑張って頂戴。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"怎样？感觉变强了吧？","text_original":"どう？強くなってきたの、分かるかしら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"看，奏效了吧？","text_original":"ほら、効いてきたでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"万魔殿，全体进攻！","text_original":"万魔殿、総攻撃よ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"呵呵，这就是我的力量。","text_original":"ふふ、これが私の力。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"哎呀，准备得真周到呢。呵呵，真是帮大忙了，老师。","text_original":"あら、用意がいいじゃない。ふふ、助かるわ先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_ExWeapon_Get.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"让您久等了，老师。我是万魔殿的情报部长，京极皋月。呵呵，请多指教。","text_original":"待たせたわね、先生。万魔殿の情報部長、京極サツキよ。ふふっ、よろしく。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"呵呵……感觉不错。进行得很顺利呢。","text_original":"ふふ……いい感じね。順調じゃない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"感觉，稍微变强了点。","text_original":"すこし、強くなった気がするわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，就照这个势头继续吧，老师？","text_original":"ふふっ、この調子で頼むわよ、先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"哼……这样目标就算达成了呢。感谢您，老师。","text_original":"ふぅ……これで目標は達成できたも同然。感謝するわ、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"我是京极皋月，万魔殿的情报部长。不过，您应该早就知道了。呵呵。","text_original":"京極サツキ、万魔殿の情報部長を務めているわ。まあ、知ってると思うけど。ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"小心别撞到桌角哦。……因为那样会很疼的。","text_original":"デスクの角に足をぶつけないよう、気をつけなさい。……だってそれ、痛いじゃない。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"夏莱的机密情报会放在哪呢……","text_original":"シャーレの機密情報ってどこにあるのかしらね……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"……说不定会意外地藏在茶水间？呵呵。先从零食库存开始调查吧。","text_original":"……意外と給湯室にあったりして？ふふっ。お菓子のラインナップから調べてみようかしら。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您对NK Ultra计划感兴趣吗？","text_original":"先生、NKウルトラ計画に興味はあるかしら？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"现在的话，可以破格允许您加入哦？","text_original":"今なら破格の条件で迎え入れてあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"好好看着这个钟摆……来…老师，您变得要下班~……想要摸鱼~……","text_original":"この振り子をよくみて……さあ……先生は退勤したくなぁ～る……仕事をサボりたくなぁ～る……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"……您一直都这么想？哼。","text_original":"……常にそう？ふぅん。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_LogIn_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"您好，老师。今天值日的是我哦。呵呵。","text_original":"こんにちは、先生。今日の当番は私よ。ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_LogIn_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_LogIn_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师是万魔殿的合作候选人。我就借此机会，好～好观察一下您吧。呵呵。","text_original":"先生は万魔殿の協力者候補。この機にじ～っくり、観察させてもらおうかしら。ふふ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_LogIn_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"哎呀？您当我是谁啊？夏莱的工作，我一下子就全部帮你搞定。","text_original":"あら？私を誰だと思っているの？シャーレの仕事くらい、一瞬で終わらせてあげる。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_LogIn_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"呜呜……怎么了，这是……？","text_original":"うう……なによ、これ……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"好、好奇怪……感觉必须得遵从，老师的命令……","text_original":"へ、変だわ……先生の命令に、従わないといけない気持ちに……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"诶、诶……好的……","text_original":"え、えっ……はい……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我要和……风纪委员会……好好，相处。","text_original":"……私は、風紀委員会と……仲良く、します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"……不过真琴先不提，我和她们本来关系也不差。","text_original":"……でもマコトちゃんならまだしも、私は別に仲が悪いわけじゃないのよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"嗯，嗯？","text_original":"う、うん？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"咕……我……不会……再捉弄……老师，了……","text_original":"くっ……私は……先生に……意地悪……しませ、ん……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"太、太卑鄙了！","text_original":"ひ、卑怯よ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"明明是大人，却用催眠术对我为所欲为！","text_original":"大人のくせに、催眠で私に好き勝手して！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"哼，竟敢对我施加催眠……不可掉以轻心呢，老师。","text_original":"ふん、この私に催眠をかけるだなんて……油断ならないわね、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"怎样？有兴趣加入我的NKUltra计划吗？","text_original":"どう？私のNKウルトラ計画に参加する気はない？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_MemorialLobby_6","category":"lobby","text":"好、好的……如果这是您的命令的话……","text_original":"は、はい……ご命令なら……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_MemorialLobby_6.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"这便是建立信任的过程，对吧？","text_original":"これも信頼を築いていく過程、でしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Relationship_Up_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"您相信我的，对吧？老师？","text_original":"私のこと、信じてるわよね？先生？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Relationship_Up_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"感觉和老师的距离更近了些呢。而且……近了许多呢。呵呵。","text_original":"先生との距離が縮まった気がするわ。それも……かなり。ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Relationship_Up_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"以后，老师就永远待在我身边吧。……拒绝的权利？您觉得您会有吗？呵呵。","text_original":"先生にはこの先もずうっと、私のそばにいてもらおうかしら。……拒否権？あると思うの？ふふっ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Relationship_Up_4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"哼~，我的生日，您记得呀。不愧是夏莱的情报收集能力。真是我们的劲敌。","text_original":"ふ～ん、私の誕生日、覚えていたの。さすがはシャーレの情報収集能力。私たちのライバルなだけあるわね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过话说回来……谢谢您的祝福。","text_original":"それはそうと……お祝いの言葉、感謝するわ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天是老师的生日对吧？当然记得哦。老师可是万魔殿的合作候选人，是相当重要的人哦。","text_original":"今日は先生の誕生日でしょう？ええ、もちろん覚えてるわ。万魔殿の協力者候補として、先生の存在は貴重だもの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"……不过，就算不是那样，我也肯定会记得的。","text_original":"……まぁ、そうでなくても覚えていたと思うけど。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_3","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，生日快乐，老师。","text_original":"ふふ、お誕生日おめでとう、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Birthday_Player_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"万圣节是伊吹最期待的日子呢。","text_original":"ハロウィーンはイブキが楽しみにしている日なの。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"糖果都准备好了吗？呵呵，我也很期待哦。","text_original":"お菓子の用意はいいかしら？ふふっ、私も楽しみにしてるのよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_NewYear_1","category":"lobby","text":"新年快乐，老师。","text_original":"明けましておめでとう、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_NewYear_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_NewYear_2","category":"lobby","text":"希望今年能在老师您的协助下，顺利推进NKUltra计划。","text_original":"今年こそ、先生に協力してもらった上で、NKウルトラ計画に進展があるといいわね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_NewYear_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您喜欢吗？","text_original":"先生、好き？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"……我是说圣诞的气氛哦。","text_original":"……クリスマスムードのことよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Season_Xmas_3","category":"lobby","text":"……误会？误会了什么？","text_original":"……勘違いしたって、何を？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Season_Xmas_3.ogg"},{"description":"CH0080_Title","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ブルー、アーカイブ～","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/CH0080_Title.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"あら、私の催眠術が必要なの？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/ch0080_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"例のアレをお披露目する時がきたのね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/jp/ch0080_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0080_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_eventlobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_3_3","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E4%BA%AC%E6%9E%81%20%E7%9A%8B%E6%9C%88/original/kr/ch0080_eventlobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0080_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kiv